@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowThickness 2
skinparam ParticipantPadding 12
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam Padding 6
skinparam SequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam MaxMessageSize 80
hide footbox

actor 用户 as U
participant "Android APP" as APP
participant "云端 API" as API
participant "MQTT Broker" as MQ
participant "树莓派设备" as PI

U -> APP: 点击“开锁”
APP -> API: POST /api/control/unlock\nAuthorization: Bearer JWT
API -> API: 写入命令记录\n(MySQL: status=pending)

alt MQTT 可用（主通道）
  API -> MQ: publish cmd\ndoorbell/{device_id}/cmd
  MQ -> PI: cmd 下发（subscribe）
  PI -> PI: 执行开锁\n(GPIO/电机)
  PI -> API: POST /api/device/command_result\n上报执行结果
  API -> API: 更新命令状态\nexecuted/failed
else MQTT 不可用（兜底：心跳轮询）
  PI -> API: POST /api/device/heartbeat\n拉取待执行命令
  API --> PI: 返回 pending 命令\n(HTTP 响应)
  PI -> PI: 执行开锁\n(GPIO/电机)
  PI -> API: POST /api/device/command_result\n上报执行结果
  API -> API: 更新命令状态\nexecuted/failed
end

API --> APP: 返回“命令已下发/状态可查询”
APP --> U: 提示：成功/失败
@enduml
